{"title": "Hiring Update: Progress and Next Steps", "slides": [
  {
    "title": "Roles Open",
    "bullets": [
      "Product Manager – focused on scaling core features",
      "Data Engineer – to support analytics infrastructure",
      "UX Designer – for improved user journey mapping",
      "DevOps Engineer – to enhance CI/CD pipelines"
    ],
    "notes": "We’ve identified four key roles that align with our current growth priorities. Each role supports a specific area of product development and operations. These are the most critical hires to advance our roadmap in the next quarter.",
    "layout": "bullets"
  },
  {
    "title": "Pipeline Status",
    "bullets": [
      "30% of roles have active candidate pipelines",
      "15% in early screening, 10% in interviews",
      "Strong signals from top-tier tech hubs and referrals",
      "Average time to fill: 6 weeks"
    ],
    "notes": "Our pipeline is showing steady momentum, especially in engineering and design. Early screening is progressing well due to targeted outreach. We’re seeing strong interest from experienced professionals in key markets. The timeline remains realistic with current activity levels.",
    "layout": "bullets"
  },
  {
    "title": "Key Risks",
    "bullets": [
      "Skill gaps in niche data engineering tools may delay timelines",
      "High competition in UX design roles could impact quality of hire",
      "Remote hiring challenges in certain regions may affect availability",
      "Candidate turnover risk if onboarding isn’t structured effectively"
    ],
    "notes": "We need to be mindful of skill mismatches and market saturation in specific areas. We’ll mitigate these by refining our job descriptions and strengthening our onboarding process. Regional hiring constraints require proactive outreach strategies.",
    "layout": "bullets"
  },
  {
    "title": "Next Steps",
    "bullets": [
      "Finalize role descriptions and compensation bands by [date]",
      "Launch targeted outreach campaigns in Q3",
      "Establish hiring committee to review candidate fit and timelines",
      "Schedule bi-weekly check-ins with hiring leads"
    ],
    "notes": "We will move quickly to finalize roles and set clear expectations. Targeted outreach will ensure we reach the best talent in key markets. A cross-functional hiring committee will help maintain alignment across teams. Regular check-ins will keep us agile and responsive.",
    "layout": "bullets"
  }
]}

